# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REAL CLIENT DATA - never commit, never publish.
#
# handoff/ holds the operator's actual workbook and the JSON converted from it:
# real invoices, real business names, real contacts, real per-gallon pricing.
# None of it is needed to run the app - everything in shared-data/ is generated
# by scripts/generate_timeline.py. It is kept locally only as provenance for
# how the project started.
#
# If this repo is ever shared, cloned, or pushed, these paths must not go with
# it. Removing an entry here is a disclosure decision, not a cleanup.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
handoff/data/
handoff/real-july-reference/
*.xlsx
*.xls

# Secrets
.env
.env.local
.env*.local

# Dependencies / build output
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Tooling noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.vercel
coverage/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client-identifying material - kept locally, never published.
# The public repo uses a fictional operator (Ridgeline Aviation / KXRG).
# handoff/ is the original client brief and archive; RTA-PREP.md and the brand
# guidelines describe the real client by name.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
handoff/
RTA-PREP.md
global-resources/brand-guidelines.md
scripts/convert_july_data.py
